{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 124,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.2903442382812,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "that – when compared with the currently recommended longer WHO regimens – the BLMZ and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.5635986328125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "BLLfxCZ regimens would result in large savings. Although no research evidence on cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985740661621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.421142578125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "was available, the GDG discussed that, given the moderate net benefit and large cost savings with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.1593017578125,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "BLMZ and BLLfxCZ, a judgement of cost–effectiveness favouring the intervention is appropriate. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996299743652344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4529418945312,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "judgment is based on logical arguments that a cheaper regimen with better health outcomes will be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        431.9125671386719,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "cost-effective, although the exact savings are not known without such analyses.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.1791381835938,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "For BDLLfxZ, the GDG noted that affordability will vary, depending on country (and resources available),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.4463500976562,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "health system differences and the population the regimen would be used for; accordingly, the GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        342.45941162109375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "judged that costs would vary between moderate and large.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19850158691406,
        527.3772583007812,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "Delamanid is one of the major cost drivers in BDLLfxZ. With the drug being off-patent, prices may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.40576171875,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "change with generic development. It was highlighted that a longer duration of treatment bears costs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.1920776367188,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "(especially for patients and families but also the health system) and some estimates were available and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969608306884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.435546875,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "discussed by the group. Considering these costs together with the drug costs may attenuate some",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.4223022460938,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "of the increased costs for the health system and lead to cost savings from the patient perspective.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.41455078125,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "However, countries seeking to implement a specific treatment regimen typically focus on the drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        377.8210754394531,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "cost. No evidence on cost–effectiveness was available for BDLLfxZ.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.24249267578125,
        258.4885559082031,
        328.9024963378906
      ],
      "text": "Equity, acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.11041259765625,
        527.4287109375,
        350.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "The panel considered the treatment duration and the ability to decentralize treatment (to enable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.3103942871094,
        527.46875,
        363.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "access for remote, underserved settings and disadvantaged populations) to affect equity. Despite not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98634147644043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.5104064941406,
        527.4276733398438,
        376.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "being able to identify relevant research evidence, the panel used their collective experience to judge",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.7104187011719,
        527.4345703125,
        390.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "that there would probably be advantages associated with the use of BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.910400390625,
        527.1751098632812,
        403.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "regimens, owing to their reduced complexity and shorter duration. In the case of BLMZ and BLLfxCZ,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995048522949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.11041259765625,
        527.435546875,
        416.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "the panel also highlighted the possible positive effect of the overall lower cost. Therefore, the panel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.3103942871094,
        497.8443298339844,
        429.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "judged that use of the BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ regimens would probably increase equity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.014404296875,
        527.4047241210938,
        451.4574279785156
      ],
      "text": "In judging the acceptability of the regimens, the GDG considered patients and health care providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.21429443359375,
        527.1552734375,
        464.6573181152344
      ],
      "text": "as key stakeholders. The GDG considered the regimen duration as critical with regards to acceptability,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96935749053955,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.4143981933594,
        527.4077758789062,
        477.857421875
      ],
      "text": "and therefore judged that the BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ regimens would probably be acceptable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.6144104003906,
        527.1536865234375,
        491.05743408203125
      ],
      "text": "when compared with the longer 18-month regimens. Regarding BLLfxCZ, the GDG additionally",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        489.81439208984375,
        527.4102172851562,
        504.2574157714844
      ],
      "text": "noted that clofazimine may be less acceptable (e.g. because of skin discoloration), and noted 4%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.014404296875,
        527.609375,
        517.4573974609375
      ],
      "text": "discontinuation due to clofazimine in the intervention arm in the trial. For the regimens BLLfxCZ",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.2142944335938,
        527.4027099609375,
        530.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "and BDLLfxZ, there is also one additional drug (giving a total of 5 drugs) compared with the BLMZ",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.4144287109375,
        527.4144287109375,
        543.857421875
      ],
      "text": "regimen. Regarding BDLLfxZ, the GDG highlighted that delamanid requires taking medicines twice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.6143798828125,
        527.3948364257812,
        557.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "per day in this regimen, which may affect acceptability. Despite this, the GDG judged that BLLfxCZ",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.8143920898438,
        273.36407470703125,
        570.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "and BDLLfxZ would probably be acceptable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.518310546875,
        527.3915405273438,
        591.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "In judging the feasibility, the panel highlighted that the cost of BDLLfxZ (driven by delamanid) may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.7183227539062,
        324.37548828125,
        605.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "affect feasibility for programme managers in particular.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.5354614257812,
        325.3106384277344,
        634.3875122070312
      ],
      "text": "Evidence to recommendations: considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.5955200195312,
        527.5488891601562,
        656.0385131835938
      ],
      "text": "Based on the decisions taken during the review and the combination of assessments described above,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971012115478516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.7955322265625,
        527.3914184570312,
        669.238525390625
      ],
      "text": "WHO suggests using the 9-month all-oral regimens (BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ) over currently",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.9954833984375,
        527.4014282226562,
        682.4384765625
      ],
      "text": "recommended longer (>18 months) regimens in patients with MDR/RR-TB and in whom resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.1954956054688,
        527.415771484375,
        695.6384887695312
      ],
      "text": "to FQ has been excluded. Also, WHO suggests against using 9-month DCLLfxZ or DCMZ regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.3953857421875,
        527.4739379882812,
        708.83837890625
      ],
      "text": "compared with currently recommended longer (>18 months) regimens in patients with FQ-susceptible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959074020385742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.5955200195312,
        128.2091064453125,
        722.0385131835938
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.2994384765625,
        527.5546875,
        743.742431640625
      ],
      "text": "Among the newly recommended regimens, using BLMZ is suggested over using BLLfxCZ, and BLLfxCZ",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957066535949707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.4993896484375,
        527.4288940429688,
        756.9423828125
      ],
      "text": "is suggested over BDLLfxZ. This ranking is based on an evaluation of all evidence and judgements",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.6994018554688,
        527.428955078125,
        770.1423950195312
      ],
      "text": "made for individual sub-PICOs 2.1, 2.2 and 2.3, and deliberation by the panel. The panel was first",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "110 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}